    "result_text": "The only test class in the project is `AcceptanceTest`, and the full suite passes with BUILD SUCCESS.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe acceptance test creates an owner, then reads it back via `GET /api/owners/{id}` and expects `$.selfLink` to equal `/api/owners/{id}`. I implemented the `selfLink` field on the owner response:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `selfLink` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the OpenAPI generator produces the field on `OwnerDto`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a `@Mapping(target = \"selfLink\", ...)` on `toOwnerDto` plus a `selfLink(owner)` default method that returns `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (null-safe when the owner has no id yet).\n\nBoth the targeted `AcceptanceTest` and the full test suite pass: `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 **BUILD SUCCESS**.\n\nNote: this is not a git repository, so there's nothing to commit.",
